---
import { MessageCircle, ShieldCheck, Lock } from 'lucide-react';
---
<footer class="bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-slate-600">
  <div class="container-j py-14">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs p-8 md:flex-row md:items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold !text-slate-900">Cuidado médico imediato para sua saúde</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 font-body text-sm text-slate-600">Dúvidas sobre consultas, receitas ou atestados? Nosso time atende 24 horas.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="https://wa.me/5511999990000?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C%20gostaria%20de%20iniciar%20uma%20consulta%20na%20Jopi%20Sa%C3%BAde" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#00D37B] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-[#052E16] transition hover:bg-[#00c572] shadow-xs cursor-pointer">
        <MessageCircle size={18} /> Falar no WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#00D37B] text-[#052E16] shadow-xs font-bold">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Jopi<span class="text-[#00874E]">Saúde</span></p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Consultas médicas online do seu jeito. Atendimento imediato via chat ou chamada agendada com especialistas.</p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
          <span>Pagamento seguro:</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-slate-200/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-slate-700 font-mono font-bold">PIX</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-slate-200/80 px-2 py-0.5 text-slate-700">Cartão</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Atendimento</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="#consulta-imediata" class="hover:text-[#00874E] transition">Consulta Imediata (R$ 69)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#consulta-agendada" class="hover:text-[#00874E] transition">Consulta Agendada (R$ 99)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#especialidades" class="hover:text-[#00874E] transition">Especialidades Médicas</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Como Funciona</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="#como-funciona" class="hover:text-[#00874E] transition">Passo a Passo</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq" class="hover:text-[#00874E] transition">Perguntas Frequentes</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-[#00874E] transition">Sou Médico (Cadastre-se)</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Segurança & Legal</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-[#00874E] transition">Termos de Uso</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-[#00874E] transition">Privacidade (LGPD)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-[#00874E] transition">Ética e Resoluções CFM</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-slate-200/80 pt-8 text-xs text-slate-500 sm:flex-row">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Jopi Saúde Tecnologia e Serviços Médicos Ltda. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><ShieldCheck size={14} class="text-[#00874E]" /> CFM Regulamentado</span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><Lock size={14} class="text-[#00874E]" /> Dados Criptografados</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
